        "category": "description",
        "text": "\nThis update for the SUSE Linux Enterprise Kernel 4.12.14-122.269 fixes various security issues\n\nThe following security issues were fixed:\n\n- CVE-2026-23191: ALSA: aloop: Fix racy access at PCM trigger (bsc#1258396).\n- CVE-2026-23268: apparmor: fix unprivileged local user can do privileged policy management (bsc#1259859).\n",
